  "prefLabel": "Res 8401.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 8401.02 Scope. These rules shall only apply to OHRV clubs, snowmobile clubs, and political subdivisions as defined by Res 8402.01(e), (f) and (g).\n\nSource. #9350, eff 12-24-08; ss by #10850, eff 6-17-15",
